  "body": "*\tFreehold 685 sqm land area (more or less) with spacious front and backyard\r\n\r\n*\tMixed housing suburban zone\r\n\r\n*\tEnjoying views over Half Moon Bay Marina.\r\n\r\n*\tSolid brick and tile, 5-bedroom, 3-bathroom, study, entertainment room, and double garage family home\r\n\r\n*\tSelf-contained, independent access two bedrooms, renovated kitchen, and a full bathroom (separate water and   electricity meters)\r\n\r\n*\tIn zone top schools: Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Pigeon Mountain Primary School.\r\n\r\n*\tWithin a short walk to Schools, Marina, Cafe, restaurants, local amenities, and the ferry.\r\n\r\n\r\nContact us today and start your journey towards your dream home.",
